{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "113b5f0eafd62bfa04e6022bb6e692c9eafac9ed4afb11adeb268e85fa60791b", "ja": "（劇場の備品が減ってきたので買い出しへやってきた。\nさて、買い物リストは……）", "zh": "（剧场的用具不够了，所以我出来采买。\n好，来看看购物清单……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "6da9e9faf7f828eec56cf6973941854675d67e1d6b361089bc38d90c4eba1732", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nミキのピンチに駆けつけてくれたんだね♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n你赶来解除美希的危机了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_1002_p", "source_sha256": "313cb04c3ae58fba6ca0f489a27a776719e43986e8d6f74921f652fe6cf7a60d", "ja": "いや、たまたまだけど……。\n美希、ピンチだったのか？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "不，我只是刚好经过……\n美希，你陷入危机了吗？发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "be4f1690527eefe6038d26adba8cb4165a5d01d06289405fb6534ce975ffb4a5", "ja": "あのね、ミキ、もうちょっと買いたいから、\nこれ持っててくれる？　はい♪", "zh": "是这样的，美希还想再买一点东西，\n你可以帮美希拿着这个吗？来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_1004", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "接过", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2000_p", "source_sha256": "2f472e013c3a963803480a91d1cd62553fa40cedeeb9ed58913f0c048a3702d7", "ja": "美希の荷物持ちに来た訳じゃないんだけど……。\nこれ、化粧品か？　どうしたんだ、こんなに。", "zh": "我不是来帮美希拿东西的耶……\n这是化妆品吗？怎么买这么多？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2001_003mik", "source_sha256": "d49dd92dfa5a2922d5bff66e679ed29292c8d1b6611237b2b71acaceb5104bea", "ja": "この間の公演で、ミキ、\nでこちゃんのメイクしてあげたでしょ？", "zh": "前阵子的公演，\n美希不是帮额头妹化了妆吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2002_003mik", "source_sha256": "86c1a340bc83d8c88b6e24e306fc2d7c939d4eb6e280bf81d60c503410509606", "ja": "そしたら雪歩と真くんもやってほしいって。\nだから、ふたりに合う化粧品を買いに来たの♪", "zh": "然后雪步跟阿真就说，也想要美希帮她们化，\n所以美希就来买适合她们两个的化妆品了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2003_p", "source_sha256": "add97293bc10786d46ffed6b3234e1b571d061ea4645c01baa580f71fc6b237f", "ja": "なんだ、そういうことなら付き合うよ。\nそれで次は何を買いにいくんだ？", "zh": "什么嘛，既然是这样的话，那我陪你买。\n你下一个要买什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2004_003mik", "source_sha256": "71c90520bb3dbb4bc6fbdbe2c5a0bf2e8b51c338f6fa0991c8937794b9f5fcb1", "ja": "ファンデーション。みんなの肌に合うの、\nちゃーんと選んであげなくちゃね♪", "zh": "粉底。\n要仔～细挑选适合大家肌肤的粉底才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2005_003mik", "source_sha256": "6711b2c25a0c8b84768dab2688b6f59c923dc90bdcf3116f44d096e5f41f6aa6", "ja": "あ、せっかくだから、{$P$}のも\n選んであげるね！　ミキにお任せなの♪", "zh": "啊，机会难得，也帮{$P$}挑选吧！\n交给美希♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2006_p", "source_sha256": "8ff67c35525fc1a8c5d11b568ce6148a88ff51060adfa58c72dc802403495274", "ja": "えっ、俺はいいよ。アイドルじゃないし、\nメイクしても見せる相手なんかいないし……。", "zh": "咦，我不用啦。\n我又不是偶像，化了妆也不知道给谁看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2007_003mik", "source_sha256": "0b6acf70662169a77cb16a3f76640329b5806ea1dcdba334fb8d7551ad84362c", "ja": "ミキたちが見るからいいって思うな♪\n……あ、それとも、メイクきらいだったりする？", "zh": "美希我们会看的，所以可以化呀♪\n……啊，还是说，你讨厌化妆？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2008_p", "source_sha256": "d74d22b98b50b58c8a6bfa33f75b8b3c43eaedd7619a656c8a83586dc34af91b", "ja": "いや、必要がないってだけで、嫌いじゃないけど。", "zh": "没有，我只是觉得没必要，并不是讨厌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2009_003mik", "source_sha256": "7ce2d6ef7d33fdb2b16ba28b99dc30f9b350839fd93b00c1becb14ba8c902473", "ja": "それじゃあ、ミキのメイク、どう思う？\nかわいいって、思ってくれる？", "zh": "那，你觉得美希化妆起来怎么样呢？\n会觉得可爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2010_p", "source_sha256": "a58e977ac96545050e2a35c46d6c47dc2ce8bee5f17794b503244b75984730bf", "ja": "もちろん。ノーメイクでも十分にかわいいけど\nメイクしたら、よりかわいくなると思うぞ。", "zh": "当然，美希没化妆就足够可爱了，\n如果化了妆，应该会变得更可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2011_003mik", "source_sha256": "a57842f0eb10665e198b22729bbe383dd8e1d24575053450d6175d4a430cf9a1", "ja": "あはっ、ありがとうなの！\nそれならメイクもちゃんとやってみるね♪", "zh": "啊哈！谢谢你唷！\n那美希会用心化妆的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2012_003mik", "source_sha256": "1e6aad50e7dd2da562bedb52f156adce213eb4a25a8feaa6a01ef858e02f9fae", "ja": "あっ、それと……。\nミキも、ハニーはメイクいらないって思うな。", "zh": "啊，还有……\n美希也觉得HONEY不用化妆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0113_2013_p", "source_sha256": "25213400da92e0b292a0ba192c8963a052f74830b1657f267300eb9c3e620794", "ja": "（……美希は素のままでも十分、小悪魔だな。\nその魅惑に乗って、買い物に付き合うことにしよう）", "zh": "（……美希不必化妆就十分有小恶魔的感觉了。\n就这样被她迷住，陪她一起买东西吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
